  "description": "ToolUp.Graph Core — the graph-data substrate contract: the openCypher-keyed IGraphStore interface plus its Fable-compatible value model (GraphNode / GraphEdge / PropertyValue / CypherQuery / GraphResultSet / Direction). Traversal queries the relational IEntityStore cannot express in one round-trip. Zero server/client deps; the shared floor every graph companion (in-memory default, Kùzu / Neo4j / AGE engines) is built against.",
